// In-memory demonstration, so running it does not overwrite disk save games.
// For persistent saves, choose a game/profile database path instead.
Add_Dynamic_Module World Appeal_Standard_World
Add_Dynamic_Module Storage Appeal_SQLite_Storage
Run Libraries/Game/Runtime
Run Libraries/Game/Scenes
Run Libraries/Game/Saves
Storage Open_Memory Save_Load_Demo
Set_Var Save_Database Save_Load_Demo
Call Save_Init

Define_Function Demo_Build
    World Create_Typed_Entity Player Character 1 0
    World Set Player Health 80
    World Set_Position Player 10 20 0
End_Function
Define_Function Demo_Collect
    Set_Var Save_Key Score
    Set_Var Save_Value Var Demo_Score
    Call Save_Put
End_Function
Define_Function Demo_Restore
    Set_Var Save_Key Score
    Set_Var Demo_Score (Call Save_Get)
    // Recreate Graphics/Physics/etc. resources here without recreating World entities.
End_Function
Set_Var Scene_On_Enter Demo_Build
Set_Var Save_On_Save Demo_Collect
Set_Var Save_On_Load Demo_Restore
Call Game_Start
Set_Var Scene_Next Garden
Call Scene_Request
Call Scene_Apply
Set_Var Demo_Score 42
Set_Var Save_Slot Quick_Save
Call Save_To_Slot
Print Var Save_Status
World Set Player Health 1
Set_Var Demo_Score 0
Call Save_Load_Slot
Print Var Save_Status
World Get Player Health
Print Var Demo_Score
Storage Close Save_Load_Demo
Print SAVE_LOAD_DEMO_PASSED
Done
